        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/brands"
            class="rounded-xl bg-moss hover:bg-moss-dark text-white font-bold px-7 py-3.5 shadow-lg shadow-moss/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-sm sm:text-base"
          >
            浏览 42 家机场品牌库 →
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://sahude.gsyvipaff.com/#/?code=keqgvT5Y"
            target="_blank"
            rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
            class="rounded-xl border border-line dark:border-white/20 bg-white dark:bg-white/5 hover:border-moss text-ink dark:text-white font-bold px-7 py-3.5 transition-all text-sm sm:text-base flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>首选主推 · 光速云直达</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-coral dark:text-coral-bright font-mono font-bold">券码 AMM</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Trust badges -->
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-left border-t border-line/60 dark:border-white/10 pt-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-moss text-lg">🛡</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">42 家深度核验</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-moss text-lg">⚡</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">16+ 份真实测速图</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-moss text-lg">🌐</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">全平台客户端教程</span>
