        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-64 h-64 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
          <div class="lg:col-span-7">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4">
              <span class="bg-amber-400 text-amber-950 font-black text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
                👑 2026 第一首选主推
              </span>
              <span class="bg-moss/20 text-moss dark:text-emerald-300 font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">
                2020 年运营老牌
              </span>
              <span class="bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">
                IEPL 企业级专线
              </span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-ink dark:text-white">
              光速云 · 高速专线综合旗舰
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">
              光速云是运营超 4 年的知名综合型机场，采用 <strong>IEPL 专线 + 企业级内网专线</strong> 双线路架构与 <strong>VLESS 协议</strong>。支持自研客户端与 Clash、Shadowrocket 等主流通用客户端订阅导入。
