            <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-line dark:border-white/10 bg-white/70 dark:bg-white/5 p-3">
                <span class="text-xs text-muted block">年付轻量入门</span>
                <span class="text-base font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-mono">¥99/年</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-muted block">折合约 8 元/月</span>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-line dark:border-white/10 bg-white/70 dark:bg-white/5 p-3">
                <span class="text-xs text-muted block">致敬斯诺克147</span>
                <span class="text-base font-black text-coral dark:text-coral-bright font-mono">¥147 一次性</span>
