          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">
            从免费节点蜜罐识别、IP纯净度与倍率核算工具，到 42 家同源站群防跑路雷达与 48 问百科全书。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <a
          href="/free"
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-line dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-[#102a2b] p-6 hover:border-moss hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between"
        >
          <div>
            <span class="inline-block rounded-lg bg-moss/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-moss dark:text-emerald-300 mb-3">
              🎁 免费资源与平替核验
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-black text-ink dark:text-white group-hover:text-moss transition-colors">
              2026 免费节点安全红线与 ¥147 永久包平替
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
